# FAO Forecast API — environment template.
# Copy this file to `.env` and fill in real values. Never commit `.env` (it is gitignored).

# --- Client / notebooks (01_quickstart, 02_visualization) -------------------------------
# API key for the FAO Forecast API, sent as the `X-API-Key` header. Request one from the
# VIEWS team. Required to run the live-API notebooks.
APPWRITE_DATASTORE_API_KEY=your-api-key-here

# Optional: override the API base URL. Defaults to the public production endpoint.
# VIEWS_API_URL=https://faoapi.viewsforecasting.org

# --- Server (only needed to RUN the API yourself, not to call it) -----------------------
# The full set of Appwrite server variables (endpoint, project/bucket/collection/database
# IDs) is documented in docs/ADRs/active/013_environment_variable_validation.md. Do not
# put internal infrastructure values in this template.
